<title>HONG KONG: Citibank sets warrants on Thai blue chips basket.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Thai blue chips basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. Hong Kong said on Tuesday it intended to issue 700,000 American-style call warrants on a basket of Thailand blue chips, comprising a total of seven companies.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Phatra Thanakit		    3.0235 shares</p>
<p> Jasmine				4.9156 shares</p>
<p> Siam Cement			  0.4002 shares</p>
<p> Land &amp; House			 1.1686 shares</p>
<p> Advance Info SVC		   1.1338 shares</p>
<p> Finance One			  3.0235 shares</p>
<p> Siam City Bank		     8.5130 shares</p>
<p>One warrant equivalent to one basket</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	  US$105.035   PREMIUM	 13.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	   US$14.18     GEARING	 7.41X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	    18.SEP.97    LISTING	 LONDON</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE	US$105.035</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
